          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A filled-in example household: a list, things at home and a few recipes. Each sample is marked, and you remove them all with one tap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A filled-in example household: a list, things at home and a few recipes. Each sample is marked, and you remove them all with one tap."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein gefüllter Beispielhaushalt: eine Liste, Sachen im Haus und ein paar Rezepte. Jedes Beispiel ist markiert, und mit einem Tipp sind alle wieder weg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A filter rule in your mail program can sort receipts into their own folder, e.g. “ToHuus”. Only from these senders (optional): addresses or domains, separated by commas. If you forward receipts yourself, add your own address too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A filter rule in your mail program can sort receipts into their own folder, e.g. “ToHuus”. Only from these senders (optional): addresses or domains, separated by commas. If you forward receipts yourself, add your own address too."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Filterregel in deinem Mailprogramm kann Bons in einen eigenen Ordner sortieren, z. B. „ToHuus“. Nur von diesen Absendern (optional): Adressen oder Domains, mit Komma getrennt. Wenn du Bons selbst weiterleitest, trag auch deine eigene Adresse ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flyer page, a price tag or a shared offer – ToHuus checks it against your list and what is due. Nothing is fetched from offer sites.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A flyer page, a price tag or a shared offer – ToHuus checks it against your list and what is due. Nothing is fetched from offer sites."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Prospektseite, ein Preisschild oder ein geteiltes Angebot – ToHuus gleicht es mit eurer Liste und dem ab, was fällig ist. Von Angebotsseiten wird nichts geholt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gift for your household": {
