      }
    },
    "After 90 minutes without an order. You get a heads-up 15 minutes before.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After 90 minutes without an order. You get a heads-up 15 minutes before."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach 90 Minuten ohne Bestellung. Du bekommst 15 Minuten vorher Bescheid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After anonymising, the receipt reads slightly differently (%d → %d lines). That is fine – the maintainer sees it in the file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After anonymising, the receipt reads slightly differently (%d → %d lines). That is fine – the maintainer sees it in the file."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Anonymisieren liest sich der Bon etwas anders (%d → %d Zeilen). Das ist in Ordnung – das steht für die Entwickler mit in der Datei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After cooking, one tap per person: not for me, okay, loved it. Allergies warn on dishes and are never planned automatically; ratings and dislikes nudge suggestions. Cook › Favourites shows the family favourites and each person’s.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After cooking, one tap per person: not for me, okay, loved it. Allergies warn on dishes and are never planned automatically; ratings and dislikes nudge suggestions. Cook › Favourites shows the family favourites and each person’s."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Kochen ein Tipp pro Person: nicht meins, okay, lecker. Allergien warnen bei Gerichten und werden nie automatisch eingeplant; Bewertungen und Abneigungen beeinflussen Vorschläge sanft. Kochen › Lieblinge zeigt die Familienlieblinge und die jeder Person."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After cooking, tap how everybody liked it – the family favourites collect here by themselves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After cooking, tap how everybody liked it – the family favourites collect here by themselves."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippt nach dem Kochen an, wie es allen geschmeckt hat – die Familienlieblinge sammeln sich hier von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After cooking, tap “Leftovers” – or freeze something from stock. Each container gets its own label here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After cooking, tap “Leftovers” – or freeze something from stock. Each container gets its own label here."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe nach dem Kochen auf „Reste“ – oder friere etwas aus dem Bestand ein. Jede Dose bekommt hier ihr eigenes Etikett."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After cooking: in “Cooked” say how many portions are left and where they go. Or use the plus button › Leftovers & freezing, “Leftovers” on a planned meal, or “Freeze & label” on a product.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After cooking: in “Cooked” say how many portions are left and where they go. Or use the plus button › Leftovers & freezing, “Leftovers” on a planned meal, or “Freeze & label” on a product."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Kochen: unter „Gekocht“ angeben, wie viele Portionen übrig sind und wohin sie kommen. Oder Plus-Knopf › Reste & Einfrieren, „Reste“ an einem geplanten Essen oder „Einfrieren & beschriften“ an einem Produkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Afterwards move to (optional)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
