    "Bathroom, bed linen, water filter, smoke detectors, passports: what has to be done at home, once or again and again – for everyone or only for you. One tap when done – the next date is set automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bathroom, bed linen, water filter, smoke detectors, passports: what has to be done at home, once or again and again – for everyone or only for you. One tap when done – the next date is set automatically."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bad, Bettwäsche, Wasserfilter, Rauchmelder, Ausweise: was zu Hause zu tun ist, einmal oder immer wieder – für alle oder nur für dich. Ein Tipp, wenn’s erledigt ist – der nächste Termin kommt von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
