    "Before: a few days ahead, meal ideas and the week plan prefer what would go off while you’re away, and fresh things stay off the shopping list. A short checklist comes from your home: fridge, bins, plants, care tasks that fall into the trip.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before: a few days ahead, meal ideas and the week plan prefer what would go off while you’re away, and fresh things stay off the shopping list. A short checklist comes from your home: fridge, bins, plants, care tasks that fall into the trip."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vorher: Ein paar Tage vorher bevorzugen Essensideen und Wochenplan, was während der Reise schlecht würde, und Frisches bleibt von der Einkaufsliste weg. Eine kurze Checkliste ergibt sich aus eurem Zuhause: Kühlschrank, Müll, Pflanzen, Wartungen, die in die Reise fallen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
