    "Best a separate account for the house. In Element: Settings › Help & About › Access token. Invite that account to the room. Matrix only sends. Answers in the room are not read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Best a separate account for the house. In Element: Settings › Help & About › Access token. Invite that account to the room. Matrix only sends. Answers in the room are not read."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Am besten ein eigenes Konto fürs Haus. In Element: Einstellungen › Hilfe & Info › Zugriffstoken. Lad dieses Konto in den Raum ein. Matrix sendet nur, Antworten im Raum werden nicht gelesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
