    "E.g. a cappuccino uses milk and coffee: when one of them is low, it shows “maybe not”. Serving books the amount per serving (counted items only; 0 = just watch it).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E.g. a cappuccino uses milk and coffee: when one of them is low, it shows “maybe not”. Serving books the amount per serving (counted items only; 0 = just watch it)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Cappuccino braucht z. B. Milch und Kaffee: Wird eins davon knapp, steht da „vielleicht nicht“. Beim Servieren wird die Menge pro Portion ausgebucht (nur bei gezählten Sachen; 0 = nur im Blick behalten)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
