    "Enter the dates once. In the days before, ToHuus Hub suggests meals that use up what would go off and stops putting fresh things on the list. While you’re away, only urgent notifications come through. On the way back, a welcome-home list is ready.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the dates once. In the days before, ToHuus Hub suggests meals that use up what would go off and stops putting fresh things on the list. While you’re away, only urgent notifications come through. On the way back, a welcome-home list is ready."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einmal die Daten eintragen. In den Tagen davor schlägt ToHuus Hub Gerichte vor, die aufbrauchen, was sonst schlecht wird, und setzt nichts Frisches mehr auf die Liste. Unterwegs kommen nur dringende Benachrichtigungen. Auf dem Heimweg wartet eine Willkommen-Liste."
          }
        }
      }
