          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Kalender ohne CalDAV: Der Link zeigt eure Aufgaben mit Datum und eure Termine. Ändern lässt sich darüber nichts, und der Kalender holt sich etwa stündlich den neuen Stand. Behalte den Link für dich, denn wer ihn hat, sieht die Einträge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For carrier bags, vouchers and things that never go into stock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For carrier bags, vouchers and things that never go into stock."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Tragetaschen, Gutscheine und alles, was nie in den Bestand gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For coffee from the machine or things ordered in: only for recipes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For coffee from the machine or things ordered in: only for recipes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Kaffee aus der Maschine oder Bestelltes: nur für Rezepte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example from the REWE data export (GDPR request): items you’ve bought at least three times are created as products – including the receipt abbreviations, so future e-receipts are recognised right away. No stock is booked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example from the REWE data export (GDPR request): items you’ve bought at least three times are created as products – including the receipt abbreviations, so future e-receipts are recognised right away. No stock is booked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel aus dem REWE-Datenexport (DSGVO-Auskunft): Artikel, die du mindestens dreimal gekauft hast, werden als Produkte angelegt – inklusive der Bon-Abkürzungen, damit künftige eBons sofort erkannt werden. Es wird kein Bestand gebucht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example “Wishes from Mika”, “Christmas for Mum” or a Merkliste for biscuits you saw in an article.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example “Wishes from Mika”, “Christmas for Mum” or a Merkliste for biscuits you saw in an article."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel „Wünsche von Mika“, „Weihnachten Mama“ oder eine Merkliste für Kekse aus einem Artikel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example “ice cream once a day” or “sweets only after 15:00”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example “ice cream once a day” or “sweets only after 15:00”."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel „Eis einmal am Tag“ oder „Süßes erst ab 15:00“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For fruit, veg, bread: just “full – half – low – empty”. Less upkeep.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For fruit, veg, bread: just “full – half – low – empty”. Less upkeep."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Obst, Gemüse, Brot: nur „voll – halb – wenig – leer“. Weniger Pflege."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For grown-ups": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For grown-ups"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Erwachsene"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For me": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For me"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bring mir was"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For members with a confirmed address. One-time link, 15 minutes, bound to the device that asked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For members with a confirmed address. One-time link, 15 minutes, bound to the device that asked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Mitglieder mit bestätigter Adresse. Einmal-Link, 15 Minuten, gebunden an das anfragende Gerät."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For next time": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For next time"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fürs nächste Mal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For packs, bottles, cans: count exactly. Below the minimum it goes on the list by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For packs, bottles, cans: count exactly. Below the minimum it goes on the list by itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Packungen, Flaschen, Dosen: genau zählen. Unter dem Minimum kommt es von selbst auf die Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For sign-in links, a forgotten password and “new sign-in” alerts. Only you and the admins see it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For sign-in links, a forgotten password and “new sign-in” alerts. Only you and the admins see it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Anmeldelinks, ein vergessenes Passwort und Hinweise auf neue Anmeldungen. Nur du und die Admins sehen sie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For sign-in links. Without it, you hand over a link or QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For sign-in links. Without it, you hand over a link or QR code."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Anmeldelinks. Ohne E-Mail gibst du einen Link oder QR-Code weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For social posts the caption often is the recipe – paste it if the link alone isn't enough.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For social posts the caption often is the recipe – paste it if the link alone isn't enough."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei Social-Media-Beiträgen steht das Rezept oft im Text – füg ihn ein, wenn der Link allein nicht reicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For someone else": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For someone else"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für jemand anderen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For someone who is often here – grandparents, a regular babysitter. They sign in with a link (and later a passkey or PIN) and only see what you allow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For someone who is often here – grandparents, a regular babysitter. They sign in with a link (and later a passkey or PIN) and only see what you allow."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für jemanden, der oft da ist – Großeltern, ein fester Babysitter. Die Anmeldung läuft über einen Link (später Passkey oder PIN), und sichtbar ist nur, was du freigibst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the aunt, the babysitter or a flatmate’s partner: sees only what you allow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
