    "From every receipt ToHuus remembers what you buy and how often – that’s where the suggestions on “Today” come from. And “Money” shows where it goes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From every receipt ToHuus remembers what you buy and how often – that’s where the suggestions on “Today” come from. And “Money” shows where it goes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus jedem Bon merkt sich ToHuus, was ihr wie oft kauft – daher kommen die Vorschläge unter „Heute“. Und „Geld“ zeigt, wohin es geht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From receipts and ticks ToHuus learns how often you buy things. When something is probably due, it suggests it – it never puts anything on the list by itself.": {
