    "Ideas from what is already at home, a week plan if you want one, and recipes from links, photos or a recipe package. Missing ingredients go on the list with one tap.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ideas from what is already at home, a week plan if you want one, and recipes from links, photos or a recipe package. Missing ingredients go on the list with one tap."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ideen aus dem, was schon da ist, ein Wochenplan, wenn ihr wollt, und Rezepte aus Links, Fotos oder einem Rezeptpaket. Was fehlt, kommt mit einem Tipp auf die Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If %@ has an account, the mail is on its way. Check the spam folder too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If %@ has an account, the mail is on its way. Check the spam folder too."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn es zu %@ ein Konto gibt, ist die Mail unterwegs. Schau auch im Spam-Ordner nach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it's not there": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If it's not there"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn es das nicht gibt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If parts of this already run in Home Assistant, nothing needs doing twice: ToHuus Hub takes it over and plays changes back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If parts of this already run in Home Assistant, nothing needs doing twice: ToHuus Hub takes it over and plays changes back."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn Teile davon schon in Home Assistant laufen, muss nichts doppelt passieren: ToHuus Hub übernimmt es und spielt Änderungen zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If something does not work, the app notes it here and sends it to the ToHuus team – without your lists, receipts or messages. You can also share the list yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If something does not work, the app notes it here and sends it to the ToHuus team – without your lists, receipts or messages. You can also share the list yourself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn etwas nicht klappt, notiert die App es hier und schickt es an das ToHuus-Team – ohne eure Listen, Bons oder Nachrichten. Du kannst die Liste auch selbst teilen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the server breaks, backups on the same disk break with it. ToHuus Hub can put a copy into a WebDAV folder every night, e.g. Nextcloud. One file per weekday – the folder always holds the last seven nights.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the server breaks, backups on the same disk break with it. ToHuus Hub can put a copy into a WebDAV folder every night, e.g. Nextcloud. One file per weekday – the folder always holds the last seven nights."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn der Server kaputtgeht, sind Sicherungen auf derselben Platte mit weg. ToHuus Hub kann jede Nacht eine Kopie in einen WebDAV-Ordner legen, z. B. Nextcloud. Eine Datei pro Wochentag – im Ordner liegen immer die letzten sieben Nächte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the server cannot reach the photo website, this phone can load the photos and hand them to the server. Keep this screen open until it is done.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the server cannot reach the photo website, this phone can load the photos and hand them to the server. Keep this screen open until it is done."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn der Server die Foto-Website nicht erreicht, kann dieses Telefon die Fotos laden und an den Server geben. Lass diese Ansicht offen, bis es fertig ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your household already gets its messages from the Home Assistant app, ToHuus Hub can use it instead of the browser push – per person. Which messages go out at all is still set under Notifications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your household already gets its messages from the Home Assistant app, ToHuus Hub can use it instead of the browser push – per person. Which messages go out at all is still set under Notifications."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn euer Haushalt seine Nachrichten schon über die Home-Assistant-App bekommt, kann ToHuus Hub sie statt Browser-Push nutzen, pro Person. Welche Nachrichten überhaupt rausgehen, stellst du weiter unter Mitteilungen ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
