    "More people just once: tap the planned meal and change “For … people”. The week’s shopping, “used up” after cooking and the recipe opened from the plan use that amount. A permanent change belongs in the recipe under “Our way”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More people just once: tap the planned meal and change “For … people”. The week’s shopping, “used up” after cooking and the recipe opened from the plan use that amount. A permanent change belongs in the recipe under “Our way”."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einmal für mehr Leute: Tipp auf das geplante Essen und ändere „Für … Personen“. Der Wocheneinkauf, „aufgebraucht“ nach dem Kochen und das aus dem Plan geöffnete Rezept rechnen damit. Dauerhaft ändern geht im Rezept unter „Bei uns“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
