            "value": "Einmal / festes Datum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a few receipts are in, you see here how many lines were recognised without anybody having to correct them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a few receipts are in, you see here how many lines were recognised without anybody having to correct them."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sobald ein paar Bons drin sind, siehst du hier, wie viele Zeilen erkannt wurden, ohne dass jemand korrigieren musste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a week as a suggestion for the list – paused in the holidays.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a week as a suggestion for the list – paused in the holidays."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einmal pro Woche als Vorschlag für die Liste – in den Ferien Pause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once it’s there you can say thanks. Nobody keeps score – no points, no list of who brought what.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once it’s there you can say thanks. Nobody keeps score – no points, no list of who brought what."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn es da ist, kannst du Danke sagen. Niemand führt Buch – keine Punkte, keine Liste, wer was gebracht hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One back": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One back"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eins zurück"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One container, one label.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One container, one label."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Dose, ein Etikett."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One file with everything of your household – list, stock, recipes, receipts, photos. Create a new household in ToHuus Cloud and import the file there. Sign-ins, devices, tokens and links stay here; conversations with the assistant and what others marked “only for me” as well.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One file with everything of your household – list, stock, recipes, receipts, photos. Create a new household in ToHuus Cloud and import the file there. Sign-ins, devices, tokens and links stay here; conversations with the assistant and what others marked “only for me” as well."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Datei mit allem aus eurem Haushalt – Liste, Vorrat, Rezepte, Bons, Fotos. Leg in der ToHuus Cloud einen neuen Haushalt an und importier die Datei dort. Anmeldungen, Geräte, Zugänge und Links bleiben hier, ebenso Gespräche mit dem Assistenten und was andere als „nur für mich“ markiert haben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One ingredient per line. Bullets and numbers are removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One ingredient per line. Bullets and numbers are removed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Zutat pro Zeile. Aufzählungszeichen und Nummern fallen weg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One label per container: big name, date, eat-by and a QR code. Scanning it marks eaten, thawed or thrown away. Only household members who are logged in can open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One label per container: big name, date, eat-by and a QR code. Scanning it marks eaten, thawed or thrown away. Only household members who are logged in can open it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Etikett pro Dose: großer Name, Datum, „essen bis“ und ein QR-Code. Scannen markiert gegessen, aufgetaut oder weggeworfen. Öffnen können es nur angemeldete Haushaltsmitglieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
