    "The ToHuus Hub integration puts your shopping list, meal plan and care tasks into Home Assistant: a to-do list for Assist and voice, calendars, sensors for dashboards, actions and events for automations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ToHuus Hub integration puts your shopping list, meal plan and care tasks into Home Assistant: a to-do list for Assist and voice, calendars, sensors for dashboards, actions and events for automations."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ToHuus-Hub-Integration bringt Einkaufsliste, Wochenplan und Pflege-Aufgaben in Home Assistant: eine To-do-Liste für Assist und Sprachbefehle, Kalender, Sensoren fürs Dashboard, Aktionen und Ereignisse für Automationen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address you open ToHuus with in the browser. The app needs https; plain http only works in your home network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address you open ToHuus with in the browser. The app needs https; plain http only works in your home network."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse, mit der du ToHuus im Browser öffnest. Die App braucht https, einfaches http geht nur im Heimnetz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address you sign in with. Only you and the admins see it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address you sign in with. Only you and the admins see it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse, mit der du dich anmeldest. Nur du und die Admins sehen sie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer didn't fit this version of the app. Please update the app or try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer didn't fit this version of the app. Please update the app or try again later."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Antwort passt nicht zu dieser App-Version. Bitte aktualisier die App oder versuch es später noch mal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app connects over https only. Put your server behind https (for example Caddy or a reverse proxy with Let’s Encrypt). Plain http works in your home network only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app connects over https only. Put your server behind https (for example Caddy or a reverse proxy with Let’s Encrypt). Plain http works in your home network only."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App verbindet sich nur über https. Stell deinen Server hinter https, zum Beispiel mit Caddy oder einem Reverse Proxy mit Let’s Encrypt. Einfaches http geht nur im Heimnetz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app reconnects by itself. You may need to sign in again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app reconnects by itself. You may need to sign in again."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App verbindet sich von selbst neu. Eventuell musst du dich neu anmelden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app then only shows kid mode until someone enters the parent PIN.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app then only shows kid mode until someone enters the parent PIN."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App zeigt dann nur noch den Kindermodus, bis jemand die Eltern-PIN eingibt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app then only shows kid mode until someone enters the parent PIN. Tip: turn on Guided Access (Settings › Accessibility) so the device stays in ToHuus.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app then only shows kid mode until someone enters the parent PIN. Tip: turn on Guided Access (Settings › Accessibility) so the device stays in ToHuus."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App zeigt dann nur noch den Kindermodus, bis jemand die Eltern-PIN eingibt. Tipp: Schalte den geführten Zugriff ein (Einstellungen › Bedienungshilfen), dann bleibt das Gerät in ToHuus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant knows your list, what you buy and your recipes. Allergies, children’s ages and anything health-related stay at home – unless you switch this on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant knows your list, what you buy and your recipes. Allergies, children’s ages and anything health-related stay at home – unless you switch this on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Assistent kennt eure Liste, eure Einkäufe und eure Rezepte. Allergien, das Alter der Kinder und alles rund um Gesundheit bleiben bei euch – außer du schaltest das hier ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board link only shows – it can’t change anything. It stops working when the party ends.": {
