          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recipe is in ToHuus."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Rezept ist in ToHuus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sample data has done its job. Remove it now – everything you added yourself stays.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sample data has done its job. Remove it now – everything you added yourself stays."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Beispieldaten haben ihren Zweck erfüllt. Entfern sie jetzt – alles, was du selbst eingetragen hast, bleibt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen gets darker in these hours; a tap brightens it for 30 seconds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The screen gets darker in these hours; a tap brightens it for 30 seconds."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesen Stunden wird der Bildschirm dunkler; ein Tippen hellt ihn für 30 Sekunden auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server doesn’t answer. Is it running and reachable from this iPhone (home network, VPN)?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server doesn’t answer. Is it running and reachable from this iPhone (home network, VPN)?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server antwortet nicht. Läuft er, und ist er von diesem iPhone aus erreichbar (Heimnetz, VPN)?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has no key for iPhone notifications yet, so none arrive. The household's admin or the ToHuus team can fix this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server has no key for iPhone notifications yet, so none arrive. The household's admin or the ToHuus team can fix this."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dem Server fehlt noch der Schlüssel für iPhone-Mitteilungen, deshalb kommt nichts an. Das kann der Admin des Haushalts oder das ToHuus-Team beheben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server’s certificate isn’t valid for this address. The app needs a valid certificate – Let’s Encrypt works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server’s certificate isn’t valid for this address. The app needs a valid certificate – Let’s Encrypt works."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Zertifikat des Servers passt nicht zu dieser Adresse. Die App braucht ein gültiges Zertifikat, Let’s Encrypt reicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shared list – always on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
