          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then it can take them into account when it suggests dishes. Off: unsuitable dishes are still left out, without saying why.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then it can take them into account when it suggests dishes. Off: unsuitable dishes are still left out, without saying why."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dann kann er sie bei Vorschlägen berücksichtigen. Aus: Unpassende Gerichte fallen trotzdem weg, nur ohne Begründung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then link each person (and, if you like, a family group) with a one-time link.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then link each person (and, if you like, a family group) with a one-time link."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danach verbindest du jede Person (und, wenn du magst, eine Familiengruppe) mit einem Einmal-Link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then tap a day to plan it there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then tap a day to plan it there."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dann einen Tag antippen, um es dort zu planen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no ToHuus server at this address. Is a path like /tohuus missing?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no ToHuus server at this address. Is a path like /tohuus missing?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter dieser Adresse läuft kein ToHuus. Fehlt vielleicht ein Pfad wie /tohuus?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no parent PIN yet – leaving kid mode then needs another phone to remove this tablet. Set a PIN on the profile first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no parent PIN yet – leaving kid mode then needs another phone to remove this tablet. Set a PIN on the profile first."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gibt noch keine Eltern-PIN. Zum Verlassen des Kindermodus muss das Tablet dann von einem anderen Handy aus entfernt werden. Leg am besten zuerst eine PIN im Profil fest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no receipt text for this import (photo), so the file is rebuilt from the recognised lines.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
