            "value": "ToHuus Hub ist Open Source (AGPL-3.0). Produktdaten und -bilder teilweise von Open Food Facts (ODbL / CC BY-SA). Nicht mit REWE, Thermomix/Vorwerk oder HelloFresh verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ToHuus Hub is restarting with the backup. The app reconnects by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ToHuus Hub is restarting with the backup. The app reconnects by itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ToHuus Hub startet mit der Sicherung neu. Die App verbindet sich von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ToHuus Hub reads a mailbox or folder every 10 minutes and turns PDF receipts and receipt mails into imports for review. Mails are never deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ToHuus Hub reads a mailbox or folder every 10 minutes and turns PDF receipts and receipt mails into imports for review. Mails are never deleted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ToHuus Hub liest alle 10 Minuten ein Postfach oder einen Ordner und macht aus PDF-Bons und Bon-Mails Importe zum Prüfen. Mails werden nie gelöscht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ToHuus Hub restarts and swaps the database (a few seconds).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
