    "When you correct a line while checking an import – another product, a pack of 10, “skip the carrier bag” – ToHuus Hub remembers it for this household and does it on its own next time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you correct a line while checking an import – another product, a pack of 10, “skip the carrier bag” – ToHuus Hub remembers it for this household and does it on its own next time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du beim Prüfen eines Imports eine Zeile korrigierst – anderes Produkt, 10er-Packung, „Tragetasche weglassen“ –, merkt sich ToHuus Hub das für euren Haushalt und macht es beim nächsten Mal von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you correct a receipt line while checking an import, ToHuus Hub remembers it for your household.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you correct a receipt line while checking an import, ToHuus Hub remembers it for your household."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du beim Prüfen eines Imports eine Bonzeile korrigierst, merkt sich ToHuus Hub das für euren Haushalt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you get to a shop you saved here, ToHuus asks: “You're at Lidl – open the list?”. For this, iOS has to let ToHuus notice the place even when the app is closed (“Always”). Your location is never sent anywhere – the shop places and the check stay on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you get to a shop you saved here, ToHuus asks: “You're at Lidl – open the list?”. For this, iOS has to let ToHuus notice the place even when the app is closed (“Always”). Your location is never sent anywhere – the shop places and the check stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kommst du bei einem Laden an, den du hier gespeichert hast, fragt ToHuus: „Du bist bei Lidl – Liste öffnen?“. Dafür muss iOS ToHuus den Ort auch bei geschlossener App bemerken lassen („Immer“). Dein Standort geht nirgendwohin – die Läden und der Abgleich bleiben auf diesem iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you use AI (free sentences to the assistant, receipt and fridge photos, recipe imports), ToHuus sends what you typed or photographed to {processor}. It is not used to train models. Without AI everything else keeps working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you use AI (free sentences to the assistant, receipt and fridge photos, recipe imports), ToHuus sends what you typed or photographed to {processor}. It is not used to train models. Without AI everything else keeps working."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du KI nutzt (freie Sätze an den Assistenten, Fotos von Bons und Kühlschrank, Rezept-Importe), schickt ToHuus, was du geschrieben oder fotografiert hast, an {processor}. Es wird nicht zum Training von Modellen genutzt. Ohne KI funktioniert alles andere weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
