    "While ToHuus is being tested, nobody pays – thank you for helping. When the beta ends, your household keeps what it has on its own. Nothing is charged automatically and nothing is deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While ToHuus is being tested, nobody pays – thank you for helping. When the beta ends, your household keeps what it has on its own. Nothing is charged automatically and nothing is deleted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solange ToHuus getestet wird, zahlt niemand – danke fürs Mithelfen. Nach der Beta behält euer Haushalt, was er selbst hat. Nichts wird automatisch abgebucht und nichts gelöscht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While away: only urgent notifications; nothing lands on the list by itself if nobody is home. Someone stays home (grandparents)? Then everything carries on for them. Cooking at the holiday flat gets its own small plan and list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While away: only urgent notifications; nothing lands on the list by itself if nobody is home. Someone stays home (grandparents)? Then everything carries on for them. Cooking at the holiday flat gets its own small plan and list."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterwegs: nur dringende Benachrichtigungen; nichts landet von selbst auf der Liste, wenn niemand zu Hause ist. Bleibt jemand da (Großeltern)? Dann läuft für sie alles weiter. Kochen in der Ferienwohnung bekommt einen eigenen kleinen Plan samt Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
