    "Who wants what? Start a vote with a few dishes. Everyone swipes on their own phone (results stay hidden until all are done) – or together on one device, kids included. Then one tap puts the winner into the plan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who wants what? Start a vote with a few dishes. Everyone swipes on their own phone (results stay hidden until all are done) – or together on one device, kids included. Then one tap puts the winner into the plan."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer will was essen? Starte eine Abstimmung mit ein paar Gerichten. Alle wischen am eigenen Handy (das Ergebnis bleibt verborgen, bis alle fertig sind) – oder gemeinsam an einem Gerät, Kinder inklusive. Ein Tipp übernimmt den Gewinner in den Plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever can": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whoever can"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer gerade kann"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever has time": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whoever has time"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer gerade Zeit hat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever notices something is missing puts it on the list – by typing, speaking or from a receipt. Every row shows where it came from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whoever notices something is missing puts it on the list – by typing, speaking or from a receipt. Every row shows where it came from."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer merkt, dass etwas fehlt, setzt es auf die Liste – getippt, gesprochen oder vom Bon. Jede Zeile zeigt, woher sie kommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whose money": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
