    "“Add CalDAV Account”, then enter server, user name and password from above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Add CalDAV Account”, then enter server, user name and password from above."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„CalDAV-Account hinzufügen“, dann Server, Benutzername und Passwort von oben eintragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Add a child”: name, optional year of birth, allergies. Children never sign in; parents rate dishes for them, and kid mode uses the same profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Add a child”: name, optional year of birth, allergies. Children never sign in; parents rate dishes for them, and kid mode uses the same profile."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Kind hinzufügen“: Name, optional Geburtsjahr, Allergien. Kinder melden sich nie an; Eltern bewerten Gerichte für sie, und der Kindermodus nutzt dasselbe Profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Add a permanent guest” (grandma, a regular babysitter) and choose what they see: ordering & shopping list, + stock, + recipes & plan, or like family. Settings, spending, receipts, backups and care notes stay hidden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Add a permanent guest” (grandma, a regular babysitter) and choose what they see: ordering & shopping list, + stock, + recipes & plan, or like family. Settings, spending, receipts, backups and care notes stay hidden."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Festen Gast hinzufügen“ (Oma, ein fester Babysitter) und wählen, was sichtbar ist: Bestellen & Einkaufsliste, + Vorrat, + Rezepte & Plan oder wie Familie. Einstellungen, Ausgaben, Kassenbons, Backups und Pflege-Notizen bleiben verborgen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Admins only” keeps a password as emergency access when SSO or e-mail are down.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Admins only” keeps a password as emergency access when SSO or e-mail are down."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Nur Admins“ hält ein Passwort als Notzugang bereit, falls SSO oder E-Mail ausfallen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Always at home” (the house icon) is for salt, oil and the like – it always counts as in stock and never lands on the list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Always at home” (the house icon) is for salt, oil and the like – it always counts as in stock and never lands on the list."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Immer im Haus“ (das Haus-Symbol) ist für Salz, Öl und Co. – zählt immer als vorrätig und landet nie auf der Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Done” passes it to the next one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Done” passes it to the next one."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Erledigt“ gibt sie an die nächste Person weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Done” takes it from stock and puts it on the shopping list when none is left for next time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Done” takes it from stock and puts it on the shopping list when none is left for next time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Erledigt“ bucht es aus dem Bestand und setzt es auf die Einkaufsliste, wenn fürs nächste Mal keins mehr da ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“From stock” items are marked out when they run out, and serving books them out. Menu-only items (tap water, coffee) are never counted – give them ingredients from stock to see when milk or coffee runs low.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“From stock” items are marked out when they run out, and serving books them out. Menu-only items (tap water, coffee) are never counted – give them ingredients from stock to see when milk or coffee runs low."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sachen „aus dem Bestand“ werden als alle markiert, wenn nichts mehr da ist, und beim Servieren ausgebucht. Sachen „nur auf der Karte“ (Leitungswasser, Kaffee) werden nie gezählt – gib ihnen Zutaten aus dem Bestand, dann siehst du, wenn Milch oder Kaffee knapp wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Frozen” places are offered for freezing, “chilled” ones for leftovers. Nothing else depends on the name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Frozen” places are offered for freezing, “chilled” ones for leftovers. Nothing else depends on the name."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Gefrorene“ Orte werden zum Einfrieren angeboten, „gekühlte“ für Reste. Am Namen hängt sonst nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“How much did we spend at Aldi this month?”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“How much did we spend at Aldi this month?”"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Wie viel haben wir diesen Monat bei Aldi ausgegeben?“"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“How would you like it?” is a note for the person bringing it. “Who brings it?” asks one person – or whoever can.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“How would you like it?” is a note for the person bringing it. “Who brings it?” asks one person – or whoever can."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Wie hättest du’s gern?“ ist eine Notiz für die Person, die es bringt. „Wer bringt’s?“ fragt eine Person – oder wer gerade kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Milk is out, and we need something for Sunday.”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
